T","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21744","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33019","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65206","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"304479","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"20660","synopsis":"血雲教に潜入し危機に陥ったものの、居合わせた瑠璃仙の活躍で無事帰還した朱秦。今度は、短期間で規模を拡大させたという新教派・智教の調査を依頼するため、大明国の修士関係の行政を司る光明府に向かった。そこで彼は、同期の外門弟子・岳謦瑶と、王陸と行動を共にしていたはずの聞宝と再開する。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"血雲教に潜入し危機に陥ったものの、居合わせた瑠璃仙の活躍で無事帰還した朱秦。今度は、短期間で規模を拡大させたという新教派・智教の調査を依頼するため、大明国の修士関係の行政を司る光明府に向かった。そこで彼は、同期の外門弟子・岳謦瑶と、王陸と行動を共にしていたはずの聞宝と再開する。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21744","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33019","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65206","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"304479","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"20659","synopsis":"人手不足の光明府に智教が労働力を提供する代わりに、智教を公認してもらう交渉が開始された。岳謦瑶も味方につけた王陸を面白く思わない朱秦は、彼の所業を霊剣山の長老に報告。第二長老の劉顕らから出頭を命じられた王陸だったが、事情聴取の場で無謀な申し出をする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"人手不足の光明府に智教が労働力を提供する代わりに、智教を公認してもらう交渉が開始された。岳謦瑶も味方につけた王陸を面白く思わない朱秦は、彼の所業を霊剣山の長老に報告。第二長老の劉顕らから出頭を命じられた王陸だったが、事情聴取の場で無謀な申し出をする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21744","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33019","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65206","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"304479","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"20658","synopsis":"自分の行いに不徳がないことを証明するために、戦いの中で心を問われる「問心剣を求めた王陸。まずは不意打ちで大技を披露し、下界に降りてからの試練の成果を見せつける。しかし元嬰長老である劉顕と王陸の力の差は計り知れない。そして王陸は悪夢の世界に堕とされ、過酷な試験が始まった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"自分の行いに不徳がないことを証明するために、戦いの中で心を問われる「問心剣を求めた王陸。まずは不意打ちで大技を披露し、下界に降りてからの試練の成果を見せつける。しかし元嬰長老である劉顕と王陸の力の差は計り知れない。そして王陸は悪夢の世界に堕とされ、過酷な試験が始まった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21744","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33019","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65206","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"304479","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"20662","synopsis":"怪我を負ったものの、なんとか「問心剣の試験に合格することができた王陸。それでも霊剣派の長老たちは王陸に、智教を解散し罰を受けることを求めた。彼らに智教を認めさせるために、王陸が取った手段とは？　そしてついに、王陸の試練の旅は終わりを迎える−−。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"怪我を負ったものの、なんとか「問心剣の試験に合格することができた王陸。それでも霊剣派の長老たちは王陸に、智教を解散し罰を受けることを求めた。彼らに智教を認めさせるために、王陸が取った手段とは？　そしてついに、王陸の試練の旅は終わりを迎える−−。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOMtr0zD8VTjTFHNqNvNjHK4VUd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":21744,"malId":33019},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21744","mal:33019"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12030","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21744","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33019","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65206","scope":"s2","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"304479","scope":"s2","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":1002,"title":null,"title_eng":"Reikenzan: Eichi e no Shikaku","slug":"reikenzan-eichi-e-no-shikaku","plot":"Seguito di Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage Una cometa sta per entrare in rotta di collisione con la Terra, portando con sé distruzione e calamità . L'antico clan Reiken deve trovare il prescelto che possa scongiurare il disastro. in un'altra fonte, la cometa è già  caduta sulla Terra, provocando calamità  naturali e devastazioni. Viene quindi deciso di reclutare nuovi discepoli. Il protagonista, che possiede un'anima speciale, così rara da nascere solo ogni mille anni, decide di unirsi al Reiken e di iniziare il suo camino verso la saggezza e l'illuminazione. Il tutto condito da molte simpatiche gag.","type":"TV","status":"Terminato","date":"2017","studio":"Studio DEEN","dub":0,"mal_id":33019,"anilist_id":21744,"imageurl":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/21744-UL1QeLlLzErd.png","imageurl_cover":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/21744-mruXr5r24HCk.jpg","cover":null,"score":"7.31","episodes_count":12,"genres":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"related":[{"id":1001,"title":null,"title_eng":"Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage","type":"TV","date":"2016","episodes_count":12},{"id":1002,"title":null,"title_eng":"Reikenzan: Eichi e no Shikaku","type":"TV","date":"2017","ep